WEBVTT


00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:02.100
On your lunch break, don't forget to check your state,

00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:03.180
county, and city portals.

00:00:03.181 --> 00:00:06.280
They have hundreds and thousands of government contract opportunities.

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:09.300
Simple things that you probably already have experienced doing.

00:00:09.301 --> 00:00:12.300
There is a lot of money to be made with boring,

00:00:12.301 --> 00:00:14.660
essential, repeatable services.

00:00:14.661 --> 00:00:16.380
Also, don't forget to drink your water.

00:00:16.381 --> 00:00:17.918
Hope this helps. Have a good one!
